    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2396" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ămygdălĭnus</span></b> ,
			a, um, adj.
		id.. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Of</i> or <i>from almonds</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">oleum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					15, 7, 7, § 26</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			Pruna, i. e. <i>ingrafted on an almond-tree</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 15,
				13, 12, § 42</span></i>.</div>
